: 1) should provide one ID referencing a texture (IDs provided: 0).\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:5200 - Parameter \"uniform_set\" is null.\n  ERROR: Uniforms were never supplied for set (0) at the time of drawing, which are required by the pipeline.\n  ERROR: Texture (binding: 0, index 0) is not a valid texture.\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:5200 - Parameter \"uniform_set\" is null.\n  ERROR: Uniforms were never supplied for set (0) at the time of drawing, which are required by the pipeline.\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6147 - Attempted to free invalid ID: 0\n  ERROR: servers/rendering/rendering_device.cpp:6147 - Attempted to free invalid ID: 0\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nImport a texture with compress mode set to 'VRAM Compressed'.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21146414/test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/108445/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray"